HELP.md
# Maven Wrapper
#
# The scripts and the .properties file ARE version-controlled: they are what allows
# building the project without Maven installed, and it is what continuous
# integration uses.
#
# Justo's previous template ignored these three paths because it did not include
# a wrapper. Keeping that exclusion here breaks the pipeline with
# "./mvnw: No such file or directory".
#
# The only artifact that is NOT version-controlled is the jar, which mvnw downloads
# on its own (distributionType=only-script does not need it).
.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
build/
.gradle/

# SDD process artifacts stay local: only proposal, specs, design and tasks are
# durable and versioned; exploration/apply-progress/verify/archive reports and
# state tracking are working notes regenerated by each SDD phase run.
openspec/changes/**/exploration.md
openspec/changes/**/apply-progress.md
openspec/changes/**/verify-report.md
openspec/changes/**/archive-report.md
openspec/changes/**/state.yaml
.atl/
